  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The personal music library",
    "overview": "Rhythm uses the user-approved desktop prototype as its visual authority: a navy and charcoal workspace in which album artwork leads and controls remain restrained. White titles, muted metadata, thin dividers, and blue state cues keep a dense personal collection readable.\n\nThis record describes the implemented desktop app in src/renderer/style.css and src/renderer/App.tsx. It captures reusable visual behavior rather than extending the identity to future mobile or marketing surfaces.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Artwork leads the library view.",
